title: Sloane_Recruitment
---
===
Sloane_Intro
===

Sloane: You're the Walker everyone's whispering about. Let's see if you're worth the scrap.

-> I've heard you run the best crew in Sector 8.
    === Sloane_Flattery ===
-> I don't care about whispers. I care about results.
    === Sloane_Results ===
-> Who's asking?
    === Sloane_Direct ===

===
Sloane_Flattery
===

Sloane: Flattery gets you nowhere, but honesty gets you everywhere.
Sloane: I run this operation because I deliver. You need a crew, I have one.

<<set $sloane_loyalty = $sloane_loyalty + 5>>

-> Name your price.
    === Sloane_Price ===
-> I don't need a crew. I need you.
    === Sloane_Surprised ===

===
Sloane_Results
===

Sloane: Good answer. I respect pragmatism.
Sloane: The Purified have been muscling in on my territory. Help me push them back, and I'm yours.

<<set $sloane_loyalty = $sloane_loyalty + 10>>

-> Deal. What's the plan?
    === Sloane_Trial ===

===
Sloane_Direct
===

Sloane: Sloane. Crew leader, Scavenger affiliate, and the person who decides whether you leave this mine breathing.
Sloane: But I like your spine. Most people shrink when I stare.

<<set $sloane_loyalty = $sloane_loyalty + 10>>

-> I need someone with guts. You're hired.
    === Sloane_Accepted ===
-> Prove you're worth my time.
    === Sloane_Trial ===

===
Sloane_Price
===

Sloane: My crew needs supplies. Medical, ammo, fuel. Get me enough to restock, and we can talk.

<<if $scrap >= 100>>
    -> I have 100 Scrap. Take it. (Recruit Sloane)
        === Sloane_Accepted ===
<<endif>>
    -> I'll come back when I have more. (End)

===
Sloane_Surprised
===

Sloane: ...you're serious. Huh.
Sloane: Most people want my crew. You want me. That's... different.

<<set $sloane_loyalty = $sloane_loyalty + 15>>

-> The best leaders fight at the front. I saw that in you.
    === Sloane_Accepted ===

===
Sloane_Trial
===

Sloane: Scavengers raided a Purified supply convoy. Intel says they cached the goods in the Ash Plains.
Sloane: Bring me something valuable. I'll know if you're worth following.

-> Done. I'll be back with your prize.
    === Sloane_Accepted ===

===
Sloane_Accepted
===

Sloane: Alright, Walker. You've got yourself a deal.
Sloane: I run a tight ship. No heroics, no stupid risks. We work smart, we survive.

<<set $sloane_loyalty = 30>>
<<set $sloane_recruited = true>>
<<set $active_companions += 1>>
<<set $party: "Sloane" = true>>
<<set $quest_sloane_payback = "active">>

Sloane <<companion_join>>
<<give_item chrome_rifle>>

-> Welcome to the team, Sloane. (Recruitment Complete)
    === Sloane_Joined ===

===
Sloane_Joined
===

Sloane: Let's get to work. <<signal>>
    -> Let's move. (End)
